d":"132","parent":"130","text":"Apnea CENTRAL más frecuente en IC severa","guid":"l94J3szCTB6Dzcd1TePPzA","children":[{"id":"133","parent":"132","text":"Cheyne-Stokes → marcador gravedad IC","guid":"zy5blJJARiOtZIMazAjrjw","children":[]},{"id":"134","parent":"132","text":"No tratar con CPAP → ASV contraindicada si FEVI <45% (SERVE-HF)","guid":"_3kqYe2tSMKI0HDACqtRBw","children":[]}]},{"id":"135","parent":"130","text":"AOS en IC → CPAP sí beneficia","guid":"3frQHln3SeOK8tqEwUJQyg","children":[{"id":"136","parent":"135","text":"↓ PA nocturna, mejora FEVI","guid":"W-tdz1HrSjKzeeRF1vfMEA","children":[]},{"id":"137","parent":"135","text":"Mejora calidad sueño y funcionalidad diurna","guid":"53-brCj-QXq7pjF_CSD54w","children":[]}]},{"id":"138","parent":"130","text":"Screening → STOP-Bang + Epworth en todo IC","guid":"W_fIa71oT_qYxa3CIRGLmQ","children":[]},{"id":"139","parent":"130","text":"Derivar si sospecha → poligrafía domiciliaria","guid":"F5_2oynhSKq5LKBRPte8xA","children":[]}]},{"id":"140","parent":"0","text":"Disfunción tiroidea","guid":"z-oo7O80TbO2u2F8H6P_ng","children":[{"id":"141","parent":"140","text":"Hipotiroidismo subclínico → prevalente en AM con IC","guid":"hoDwo176QYi4KizfC9GYQw","children":[{"id":"142","parent":"141","text":"TSH 4.5-10 → zona gris","guid":"DtvlAEm8SKCJ4CL_dbUGMA","children":[]},{"id":"143","parent":"141","text":"Empeora disfunción diastólica","guid":"sAAQnhY4RwOItI7TaiH_Ag","children":[]},{"id":"144","parent":"141","text":"Tratar si TSH >10 o síntomas claros","guid":"ClmajFXzQpS2HeOKK_25fQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"145","parent":"140","text":"Hipertiroidismo → causa FA y IC de alto gasto","guid":"B_8KwWd_RMeKzSmQeDjOSA","children":[]},{"id":"146","parent":"140","text":"Amiodarona → vigilar tiroides cada 6 meses","guid":"0aMBe3g1SG6l37oyx1Y6gw","children":[]},{"id":"147","parent":"140","text":"Levotiroxina → iniciar dosis baja en IC (12.5-25 μg)","guid":"z3FPUFOWSfay387aW1qogg","children":[]}]},{"id":"148","parent":"0","text":"Sarcopenia","guid":"Mue3vxlxTQqEneRwiBczQg","children":[{"id":"149","parent":"148","text":"Prevalencia en IC → 20-50%","guid":"wbO3km2gSjim7ggO8JtKwQ","children":[]},{"id":"150","parent":"148","text":"Sarcopenia cardíaca (Bozkurt JACC 2021;77:1454-69)","guid":"AKvoztxtRr6Qiq4B24Cz9w","children":[{"id":"151","parent":"150","text":"Pérdida masa muscular esquelética Y cardíaca","guid":"Jkh6etvaTLa8KrVgoo-6Dw","children":[]},{"id":"152","parent":"150","text":"Miopatía diafragmática → disnea desproporcionada","guid":"7OfGt97hTCyuxp4w4zkWFw","children":[]}]},{"id":"153","parent":"148","text":"Criterios EWGSOP2","guid":"04zDUSnPToaXiJhyuEltKA","children":[{"id":"154","parent":"153","text":"Fuerza (grip o chair stand) → screening","guid":"wdWhIl9SQp6wIr2zFlNvRg","children":[]},{"id":"155","parent":"153","text":"Masa muscular (DXA, BIA) → confirmación","guid":"gTnM966ASSyyXjpb2WOZNA","children":[]},{"id":"156","parent":"153","text":"Rendimiento (velocidad marcha, SPPB) → severidad","guid":"3xdwZoBeQ3SpdDO4zDbrlA","children":[]}]},{"id":"157","parent":"148","text":"Impacto → ↓ capacidad ejercicio, ↑ caídas, ↑ mortalidad","guid":"N7LOYaTCRh-3b-xZeh-_Eg","children":[]},{"id":"158","parent":"148","text":"Intervención","guid":"YpS1FLSNQeGhthh5P7pM4Q","children":[{"id":"159","parent":"158","text":"Ejercicio resistencia → PRIMERA LÍNEA","guid":"3PD7kC-9TuagJ3q4zrYIjw","children":[]},{"id":"160","parent":"158","text":"Proteína 1.2-1.5 g/kg/día","guid":"0kHTsS4OSAy4HodT3ClKDA","children":[]},{"id":"161","parent":"158","text":"Vitamina D si <30 ng/mL","guid":"Y5c-lcrQTPq3vq6KtTcwbQ","children":[]},{"id":"162","parent":"158","text":"Leucina/HMB → evidencia emergente","guid":"U88_1S4oTXq8ujmqqhk4FQ","children":[]},{"id":"163","parent":"158","text":"iSGLT2 → NO empeoran sarcopenia (datos recientes)","guid":"GNWgq8SISyu5-hwPSGxH-g","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"164","parent":"0","text":"Desnutrición","guid":"SQ_UJTj0SUaNjFW2iWU9vA","children":[{"id":"165","parent":"164","text":"Prevalencia en IC → 15-50% según criterio","guid":"JtHYo9OTRBKZpEluXoM2rQ","children":[]},{"id":"166","parent":"164","text":"MNA (Mini Nutritional Assessment) → screening","guid":"_C0ULsgrRmOl5DYEAqNuZQ","children":[]},{"id":"167","parent":"164","text":"Caquexia cardíaca → pérdida >5% peso en 12 meses","guid":"HAvOMhzwTCiCySS704i0hA","children":[{"id":"168","parent":"167","text":"Pronóstico ominoso → mortalidad >50% a 18 meses","guid":"xEFIui7TTXCjqU9-v4qPYg","children":[]}]},{"id":"169","parent":"164","text":"Restricción sódica excesiva → contribuye a inapetencia","guid":"kCyG6TqQS9ezmCA4zTrzoQ","children":[{"id":"170","parent":"169","text":"2-3 g Na/día → NO <1.5 g (SODIUM-HF trial)","guid":"bmWWZHIoQn-oY8fhrAXsTw","children":[]}]},{"id":"171","parent":"164","text":"Suplementación calórico-proteica individualizada","guid":"3idsseUoSOKSbZufrz__RQ","children":[]},{"id":"172","parent":"164","text":"Omega-3 → beneficio modesto (GISSI-HF)","guid":"S0IlsplUQSySVRrDbwdGyg","children":[]}]},{"id":"173","parent":"0","text":"Polifarmacia","guid":"pKN6Qx1iSVukwrc0Lidzxw","children":[{"id":"174","parent":"173","text":"Prevalencia ≥5 fármacos en IC → >80%","guid":"sULQoxlcSFWo0cDOmPQm-Q","children":[]},{"id":"175","parent":"173","text":"Cascada prescriptiva → efecto adverso → nuevo fármaco","guid":"YLJ5DS6FQFu6Q-GpZheRIA","children":[]},{"id":"176","parent":"173","text":"STOPP/START en IC → revisar sistemáticamente","guid":"zkYWt8qpRfyQ-7cVckgFtg","children":[{"id":"177","parent":"176","text":"STOPP → fármacos potencialmente inapropiados","guid":"vSoOF9ReSdi8LCvlVQGJnQ","children":[]},{"id":"178","parent":"176","text":"START → fármacos potencialmente omitidos","guid":"jUizeuv-SJCHuiT3IizJtg","children":[]}]},{"id":"179","parent":"173","text":"STOPPFrail → en fragilidad severa (CFS ≥7)","guid":"4I-zHH92Ty2893xKbCg0bg","children":[{"id":"180","parent":"179","text":"Deprescribir estatinas, bifosfonatos","guid":"P0kKNMuRTsauFaLrDq_y5Q","children":[]},{"id":"181","parent":"179","text":"Mantener core IC therapy + analgesia","guid":"K4B8m8byRwurKzRV6g8lWQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"182","parent":"173","text":"Interacciones frecuentes en IC","guid":"SR0gKFc5S2eVDgcRr_iJ4A","children":[{"id":"183","parent":"182","text":"AINEs → retención hídrica → descompensación","guid":"Mi2GPyD2Tc2UO_b4xPp6Eg","children":[]},{"id":"184","parent":"182","text":"Diltiazem/verapamilo → contraindicados en ICFEr","guid":"qMrSPHhWS_OVsjG-xUsMJw","children":[]},{"id":"185","parent":"182","text":"Metformina + IC → monitorizar función renal","guid":"AAi33BjTSvWa8zm35T5Ksw","children":[]}]},{"id":"186","parent":"173","text":"Carga anticolinérgica → contribuye a deterioro cognitivo","guid":"TKvw7EYaS_aAHfzPBfaUhg","children":[]}]},{"id":"187","parent":"0","text":"Instrumentos y escalas para detección","guid":"aNWwO6WgR1CsLRMjBaysxQ","children":[{"id":"188","parent":"187","text":"VGI cardíaca → 7 dominios mínimos","guid":"TtmNO8IwRS-8jF3XE3SUVg","children":[{"id":"189","parent":"188","text":"Funcional → Barthel, Lawton","guid":"flD6na4HTv2w1uHqtJLlYw","children":[]},{"id":"190","parent":"188","text":"Cognitivo → MoCA, test reloj","guid":"9l8WOt3cTzOXCObTWEoNVg","children":[]},{"id":"191","parent":"188","text":"Fragilidad → CFS, FRAIL, velocidad marcha","guid":"n7xktPhOQkKCmu_n2Nh67g","children":[]},{"id":"192","parent":"188","text":"Nutricional → MNA, albúmina","guid":"kEXn6UshRQmIV8HdiDf-qw","children":[]},{"id":"193","parent":"188","text":"Afectivo → PHQ-9, GDS-15","guid":"lSQsFUxwRYiEB6rVDsPdpg","children":[]},{"id":"194","parent":"188","text":"Social → red apoyo, cuidador","guid":"WXoX8_NRSjWFr7YunGwdfQ","children":[]},{"id":"195","parent":"188","text":"Farmacológico → STOPP/START, carga anticolinérgica","guid":"Oi7tfH8BTa2We5xV9w2mBA","children":[]}]},{"id":"196","parent":"187","text":"HFFS 2025 → específico IC + fragilidad","guid":"UBXCb3g6QZWqwOG35PYVGA","children":[]},{"id":"197","parent":"187","text":"CGA (Comprehensive Geriatric Assessment) → gold standard","guid":"F-G-SUt6Tw-rbGMh8uV1Vw","children":[]}]},{"id":"198","parent":"0","text":"Caso clínico integrador","guid":"dj1UThJJRgWEMN-XiFPQnA","children":[{"id":"199","parent":"198","text":"78 años, FEVI preservada, reingreso día 12","guid":"nHhbbuk1Rlqw9LQdv6ZvOg","children":[]},{"id":"200","parent":"198","text":"Comorbilidades ocultas encontradas","guid":"4mSdDPS5QtSzGLvzxBVvKA","children":[{"id":"201","parent":"200","text":"Déficit hierro sin anemia","guid":"2FE8sCO2SZGrzUZciXmQSA","children":[]},{"id":"202","parent":"200","text":"PHQ-9 → 14 (depresión moderada)","guid":"X0qi7GKnSVuRGrYp1Dphpw","children":[]},{"id":"203","parent":"200","text":"MoCA → 22 (deterioro cognitivo leve)","guid":"FFnnYXF4RwaWx7AX-vBPQA","children":[]},{"id":"204","parent":"200","text":"STOP-Bang → 5 (alto riesgo AOS)","guid":"q7TETxqsSnqB_CXUjVLRdA","children":[]},{"id":"205","parent":"200","text":"Sarcopenia confirmada (grip ↓ + velocidad marcha ↓)","guid":"8gDCBIDmTt-jVi7cBEmhWg","children":[]}]},{"id":"206","parent":"198","text":"Intervención multidominio → resultado","guid":"H9fbX-ffQMONsVBQgLqLWw","children":[{"id":"207","parent":"206","text":"Fe IV + sertralina + simplificación fármacos","guid":"qc3DhcKjR-Wx1BEUMO86zA","children":[]},{"id":"208","parent":"206","text":"Rehabilitación multidominio + apoyo cuidador","guid":"sUwARxV8RM6LvK-peJIQcg","children":[]},{"id":"209","parent":"206","text":"Poligrafía → AOS moderada → CPAP","guid":"Urjoo-BnSJGCFe5OBK2S2A","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"210","parent":"0","text":"Perlas Clínicas","guid":"kLsXeBclTnGVGla6XFAmYA","children":[{"id":"211","parent":"210","text":"50% de IC tienen DÉFICIT HIERRO → medir ferritina + Sat Tf SIEMPRE","guid":"QLN04YfeTa-nQkumVHY7FA","children":[]},{"id":"212","parent":"210","text":"Hierro oral es INEFICAZ en IC → solo IV (carboximaltosa/derisomaltosa)","guid":"fVvhOHOqQJi7zZmYP_AfeQ","children":[]},{"id":"213","parent":"210","text":"PHQ-9 en todo IC → depresión presente en 20-40% y es modificable","guid":"lxrnZROmRt6qPeHkzAy9lw","children":[]},{"id":"214","parent":"210","text":"Deterioro cognitivo en IC es EJECUTIVO → diferente de Alzheimer","guid":"VkAWxAqoRu6IgoxjWLPr6A","children":[]},{"id":"215","parent":"210","text":"Betabloqueantes cardioselectivos son SEGUROS en EPOC → no suspender","guid":"Reau-K-9TCqQxZxKHEDg8Q","children":[]},{"id":"216","parent":"210","text":"iSGLT2 → beneficio en IC + DM2 + posible neuroprotección","guid":"mVqUz4FCSkOT2FEdFFtWJg","children":[]},{"id":"217","parent":"210","text":"AOS en IC → CPAP sí beneficia, pero ASV CONTRAINDICADA si FEVI <45%","guid":"h5EVjre7RFibdvrHPF9bKg","children":[]},{"id":"218","parent":"210","text":"Sarcopenia cardíaca → diafragma + esquelético → disnea desproporcionada","guid":"ahb76hbAQLKdwU1M_bBLpA","children":[]},{"id":"219","parent":"210","text":"Restricción Na <1.5 g → NO recomendada → contribuye a inapetencia","guid":"RVaqwySeSlGx0Cwpc_kDgw","children":[]},{"id":"220","parent":"210","text":"Buscar TODAS las comorbilidades invisibles → cada una cambia pronóstico","guid":"ppz6j79RRqODAQJYTxoe7A","children":[]},{"id":"221","parent":"210","text":"VGI cardíaca de 7 dominios → implementar en TODA evaluación IC en AM","guid":"owJpfYixS8uhkEj2H3eX-g","children":[]},{"id":"222","parent":"210","text":"Referencias","guid":"vvnp-jC3QzesCbPOzER4oQ","children":[{"id":"223","parent":"222","text":"1. Anker SD et al. Ferric carboxymaltose in patients with heart failure and iron deficiency (AFFIRM-AHF). Lancet. 2020;396(10266):1895-904.","guid":"d-h4yZXvSXmJ_Fm8zp8eWw","children":[]},{"id":"224","parent":"222","text":"2. Bozkurt B et al. Contributory risk and management of comorbidities in chronic heart failure. J Am Coll Cardiol. 2021;77(11):1454-69.","guid":"5cUCPefGQqawrmDv-bDJWQ","children":[]},{"id":"225","parent":"222","text":"3. Ezekowitz JA et al. Reduction of dietary sodium to less than 100 mmol in heart failure (SODIUM-HF). Lancet. 2022;399(10333):1391-400.","guid":"W510dYsVROKNIGBceJstIg","children":[]},{"id":"226","parent":"222","text":"4. Vitale C et al. Heart Failure Frailty Score. ESC Heart Fail. 2025;12(1):e15187.","guid":"1P1SpXtPSJa1duYOIPwK7A","children":[]},{"id":"227","parent":"222","text":"5. Cowie MR et al. Prevalence and impact of iron deficiency in chronic heart failure. Eur Heart J. 2015;36(43):3009-16.","guid":"Z2tBBbizSPaF1GkX6s7iqg","children":[]},{"id":"228","parent":"222","text":"6. Rutledge T et al. Depression in heart failure: a meta-analytic review of prevalence, intervention effects, and associations with clinical outcomes. J Am Coll Cardiol. 2006;48(8):1527-37.","guid":"RSLdMCXJSXKFfcvWaDn70Q","children":[]},{"id":"229","parent":"222","text":"7. Cannon JA et al. Cognitive impairment and heart failure: systematic review and meta-analysis. J Card Fail. 2017;23(6):464-75.","guid":"Lk3xjmnvT72njiMgMhvlhA","children":[]},{"id":"230","parent":"222","text":"8. Crespo-Leiro MG et al. Advanced heart failure: a position statement of the HFA of the ESC. Eur J Heart Fail. 2018;20(11):1505-35.","guid":"iO-02NkcTo20c3oOVbMucQ","children":[]}]}]}]},"node_count":230,"relations":[],"cross_references":[],"specialty":"General","folder":"Apuntes-de-Clases/MUE-USS","filename":"MUE_TVP","id":"map_27","resolved_references":[]}